# A whole copy of a Structure with no code holds that operand's current body, proved while it has no code (Codex
# OPUS-CODEX-20261015-10 Q8). E's place holds Model's body, which has code, when x copies E (E: Model): the copy's
# body is not the code-free one the merge planned, so call: x is refused (l2_m2_copy_source).
E: ()
end: E
Model:
    int: v 1
    v: v + 1
end: Model
E: Model
x: merge: E
call: x
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
